  <p><b>Créditos CC-BY (v1.2.29):</b> “WWS Saab J35D Draken start/taxi” — Work With Sounds / Torsten Nilsson (CC BY 4.0); “Canadian CF-18 maneuvers” (trecho decolagem) — lonemonk (CC BY 3.0); “Torpedo launch underwater” — jobro (CC BY 3.0).</p>
